  ],
  "sessions": [],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Most of the money was not the AI thinking. Most of it was sending too much context.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=1s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We measured typical query on our project. It was sending 45,000 tokens of context, but the part of actually mattered is about 5,000 only.",
      "timestamp_sec": 56,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=56s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It's like ordering a pizza and paying for extra nine pizzas you don't eat every time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 56,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=56s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The model already got 45,000 tokens before it read the prompt. Cost already happened.",
      "timestamp_sec": 117,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=117s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "This is the most important slide. 90% of your AI cost is input.",
      "timestamp_sec": 117,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=117s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "if you cut input by 94%, you can save about 61% total. Same math, but different result. Fix the input. That's where your money goes.",
      "timestamp_sec": 172,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=172s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "By themselves, both searches miss about one in four results. Together, they miss about one in 10.",
      "timestamp_sec": 275,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=275s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Sometimes search results returns 10 results, and none of them are right. If they use the bad results, it gives confident wrong answer.",
      "timestamp_sec": 333,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=333s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We tried asking AI to judge its own results, too slow. Add 2-3 seconds every time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 333,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=333s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Some simple formula, 50% meaning score, 30% keyword score, 20% how the recent code is.",
      "timestamp_sec": 333,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=333s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It runs 0.4 milliseconds, no extra AI calls needed. The lesson we learned, simple formula beats the complex model most of the time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 333,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=333s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Without using our tool, 83 uh K tokens per questions. With our tools, uh 4.9 K tokens per questions. That is 94% less.",
      "timestamp_sec": 391,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=391s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "I want to be honest about the limits. The 94% again the worst case, reading full files every time. In a real life, the tools like a cloud code already smarter than that.",
      "timestamp_sec": 391,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=391s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We use full file base because it is the only one we can measure the same way every time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 455,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We tested on large projects with 396 files. The recall dropped almost zero. If your files each do one thing, it works well. If your files do many things, it struggles.",
      "timestamp_sec": 455,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We use a small fast model for search. It's quick. Re-indexing takes under a second. But the bigger model would find more. We chose speed over perfection.",
      "timestamp_sec": 455,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Each tool starts fresh every time. They do not share anything. You explain the same code base to three different days.",
      "timestamp_sec": 511,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=511s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "247 queries. 12.4 million tokens saved. Nearly 186 not spent. Most of the savings, 84% came from search layer. The rest of them, compression.",
      "timestamp_sec": 571,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=571s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The answer was not a better model. The answer was sending less.",
      "timestamp_sec": 571,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=571s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We argue about which model is best, Opus or Sonnet. But the models may be 30% of the cost, but other 70% is what you feed it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 571,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=571s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "claim": "About 90% of AI coding tool cost is input tokens and only 10% is output.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 117,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=117s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Optimizing output — shorter answers, max token and temperature settings — cannot meaningfully reduce AI coding spend because the cost is on the input side.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 117,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=117s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Prompt instructions to send less context are structurally useless, because the context is already transmitted and billed before the model reads the prompt.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 117,
      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=117s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
