      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=391s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "The approach degrades badly on large codebases where individual files have many responsibilities — recall dropped to nearly zero at 396 files.",
      "confidence": "stated",
