      "talk_slug": "we-cut-94-of-ai-coding-tokens-with-a-local-code-index",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRmWYHuIJxM&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "A small, fast embedding model is the right choice over a larger more accurate one, trading retrieval quality for sub-second re-indexing.",
      "confidence": "stated",
